# Source, authorship, and licence notices

`bijux-pollenomics-lra` contains a native Python adaptation of the REVEALS and
LOVE implementation distributed in the user-supplied `disqover` 0.9.14 source
archive. The archive identifies Volkmar Liebscher, Martin Theuerkauf, and Triin
Reitalu as package authors/maintainers and declares `GPL (>= 2)`. The original
scientific methods remain attributable to their published authors; this package
does not claim authorship of REVEALS, LOVE, the Gaussian plume model, or the
Lagrangian stochastic model.

